  "summary": "Coat a creature: Freedom of Movement for 8 hours. Or pour it out: a 10-foot square of Grease for 8 hours.",
  "text": "This sticky black unguent is thick and heavy in the container, but it flows quickly when poured. The oil can cover a Medium or smaller creature, along with the equipment it's wearing and carrying (one more vial for each size larger). Applying it takes 10 minutes; the creature then gains the effect of Freedom of Movement for 8 hours. Alternatively, the oil can be poured on the ground as a Magic action, where it covers a 10-foot square, duplicating the effect of the Grease spell in that area for 8 hours."
